            <description><![CDATA[<h2>AwakeMac 0.12.1 — Test release</h2>
<p>The first signed and notarized test release for macOS 14 and later, with Apple silicon and Intel support.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Timer, Until, and Unlimited keep-awake sessions.</li>
  <li>Optional closed-lid protection with configurable battery safeguards.</li>
  <li>Daily update checks, signed update information, and installation when you choose.</li>
  <li>Updates wait until keep-awake sessions and closed-lid protection have finished.</li>
</ul>
<p>A valid AwakeMac license key is required. Closed-lid behavior is still being tested across Mac models.</p>
]]></description>
